@SsoSession.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5208

### Health should return 200 without authentication
GET {{SsoSession.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Login start should redirect to the configured frontend with a new state
GET {{SsoSession.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/sso-login
Accept: text/html

### Session without an authentication cookie should return 401
GET {{SsoSession.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/session
Accept: application/json

### Refresh without an authentication cookie should return 401
POST {{SsoSession.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh-session
Accept: application/json

### An invalid authorization transaction should return 400
POST {{SsoSession.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/create-session
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"code": "invalid-code",
	"state": "invalid-state"
}

### Logout should return 204 and clear the cookie when present
POST {{SsoSession.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Accept: application/json
